# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REPO-ROOT SHARED SECRETS — template. Copy to .env and fill in real values.
# .env is gitignored; THIS .env.example is the committed template.
#
# These keys are shared across EVERY project in the repo. Each project loads
# this file FIRST, then its own project-local .env (local values override):
#   - burned v2:        auto-loaded by videos/origin-trailer/scripts/lib/env.ts
#   - node asset scripts: tsx --env-file=../../.env --env-file-if-exists=.env
#
# Convention: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE only. Mixed case silently works on Windows but
# breaks under bash/POSIX — see projects/burned/docs/insights/055-*.md.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GEMINI_API_KEY=
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
